<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 1.5 trln yen of 3-month T-bills.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 1.5 trln yen of 3-month T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan&quot;s Ministry of Finance (MOF) offered 1.5 trillion yen worth of three-month Treasury bills (T-bills) through a price competitive auction on Monday.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be February 20, 1997 and the maturity date will be May 20,1997.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
